msgid "introScreenView/blockDescription/howItWork"
msgstr ""
"A new door with gifts will be available for opening each day from "
"%(startDate)s through %(endDate)s. You can open Calendar doors for the "
"current and previous day. After %(endDate)s, doors can only be opened using "
"Holiday Ops resources."

